message: "If you use this work in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "haptic-nerve-feedback: skin-bypassing haptic feedback via electrical nerve stimulation"
abstract: >-
  An open research project developing skin-bypassing haptic feedback: electrical
  stimulation of afferent nerves (no mechanical actuators) that the brain perceives
  as touch. Staged development from a single-finger neural haptic ring toward
  whole-hand (wrist-level) and, long-term, spine-level stimulation, targeting
  applications in VR/AR, prosthetics, robot teleoperation, and virtual labs.
type: software
